  "stem": "If \\((2x + 1)^{2} = 49\\) and \\(x < 0\\), what is the value of \\(x\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "-4"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Take square roots: \\(2x + 1 = 7\\) or \\(2x + 1 = -7\\).",
    "These give \\(x = 3\\) or \\(x = -4\\). Since \\(x < 0\\), \\(x = -4\\)."
  ],
